d Pacheco, Carlos Javier and Ramos Guette, Pedro Luis and Pereira, Jaime Rendon and Diaz, Julian Rivera and Villegas, Tomas Sanchez and Suso, Juan Pablo and Torregroza Otero, Marco Antonio and Grisan, Karin and Vettus, Elen and Aktas, Bahriye and Egger, Eva and Krabisch, Petra and Muller, Andreas and Rom, Joachim and Sehouli, Jalid and Sperfeld, Antje and Wimberger, Pauline and Zorr, Andreas and Fountzilas, George and Karageorgopoulou, Sofia and Papadimitriou, Christos and Psyrri, Amanda and Zagour, Florai and Loen Chan, Karen Kar and Ho, Wing Ming and Csoszi, Tibor and Landherr, Laszlo and Novak, Zoltan and Papai, Zsuzsanna and Poka, Robert and Sipocz, Istvan and Devinder, Paul and Goyal, Lovenish and Gupta, Sudeep and Naik, Radheshyam and Patil, Tushar and Somashekhar, S.P. and Bruchim, Ilan and Kovel, Svetlana and Leibovici, Anca and Rosengarten, Ora and Safra, Tamar and Yamagami, Wataru and Hamanishi, Junzo and Imai, Yuichi and Kado, Nobuhiro and Kamiura, Shoji and Kato, Hienori and Kondo, Eiji and Kudaka, Wataru and Matsumoto, Takashi and Mori, Masahiko and Nishikawa, Tadaaki and Nishio, Shin and Okamoto, Aikou and Yunokawa, Mayu and Sekine, Masayuki and Sumi, Toshiyuki and Takano, Hirokuni and Takehara, Kazuhiro and Brasiuniene, Birute and Inciura, Arturas and Jonuskiene, Goda and Cabrera Luviano, Jesus Elvis and Dominguez-Andrade, Adriana and Gerson-Cwilich, Raquel and Hernandez, Carlos Hernandez and Hernandez, Jesus Lopez and Martinez Lira, Jose Luis and Navarrete Aleman, Jaime Esteban and Contreras, Jessica Reyes and Camargo, Vanessa Rosas and Bednarek, Wieslawa and Klasa-Mazurkiewicz, Dagmara and Kubiatowski, Tomasz and Potemski, Piotr and Sikorska, Magdalena and Chang, Suk-Joon and Hong, Sook Hee and Kang, Sokbom and Kim, Byoung-Gie and Kim, Jan-Weon and Kim, Yong Man and Lee, Jung-Yun and Ryu, Sang Young and Song, Yong Jung and Kirtbaya, Dmitriy and Kreynina, Julya and Lisyanskaya, Alla and Makarova, Yulia and Orlova, Rashida and Pirmagomedov, Albert and